  "solution": "Ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>cos</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>sin</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDo các hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều liên tục trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>ℝ</mi></semantics></math>, nên hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> liên tục trên khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>;<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
